ategory":"growup","text":"","text_original":"ははっ！先生、いい選択だな！期待してろよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/an6sQHZBecJjM0IrU737qjRgICxLtwTy.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_Growup_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"へぇ、いい感じじゃねぇか。何でも任せろ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/eqoXi2YLStr0xOcXhgHAGmTmec5Aojhc.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_Growup_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"いやぁ、うきうきするな！始めようぜ、先生！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/VnTdHS2XHXGvSRTnG2wcrV61FVjPY6P1.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_Growup_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"先生、自信を持て。あたしがそばにいるからよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/GmhVlgFrvKYsLIKby5Vp6XLFFbdZ2PY6.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_Lobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ったく、あたしを待たせるとは、呆れたもんだぜ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/Psb8zsw3YUjFWHj6iIgeOWcfyRYLdw5Q.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_Lobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"さあ～て、掃除でもしに行くか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/wCizVE9nmMUqxm2vJ4ydltTznIpv1YDL.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_Lobby_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"最高の奴と一緒に働く感覚、もう分かっただろ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/oCOjgZZjLqWJGSOJBhoM8bxsa9sTWX60.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_Lobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"仕事はきっちりやるぞ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/kFdTUQtJizoTQVNIQOqWlJme5NqCriRI.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_Lobby_5.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"助けが必要ならいつでも言えよ。何でもやってやる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/Quszf0Wy1RJ0GQnv71fSeenuWkOAdlv2.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_LogIn_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"よお、先生！遅かったじゃん。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/GwEz0aQLvhaGZUv6MO4QzlfgiYI7mHaT.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_LogIn_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ほら、先生！今日も楽しく行こうぜ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/0Ny1o5Rv1GMkltDZzOXH5MDub44Rc7fE.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_MemorialLobby_1_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ようこそ、先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/4Y1GgsxSOXbMCuL7lKjrpn1neKdWcz57.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_MemorialLobby_1_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"あたしだけの特等席、歓迎するぜ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/DeU17EmgslMsXJr2b0DRTgQfPzILcojV.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_MemorialLobby_2_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"あたしはこの学園が好きだ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/Ta4wdj5U90vwPd1zMqLTD01CeJpVroU9.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_MemorialLobby_2_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"それに…この瞬間も。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/OULGD4RT5B9aN1LKrbnE6NsIixIL8cUY.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_MemorialLobby_3_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"怖くないのかって？全然。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/lWOAQLWtP68PodKQVzAAANMysHoQbLpO.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_MemorialLobby_3_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ただ、ドキドキはしてる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/JMJD19Ane1qwDWVU7C9MdrqeQrF2Mh1t.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_MemorialLobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"まあ、たまにはサボるのも悪くねぇな。ははは！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/JTc7Y4hu6xl7JAs4rsN70JMVi9y0Ob2D.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_Relationship_Up_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"うあぁぁ！？あんまり近づくな！ぶっ殺すぞ、ぶっ殺すっての！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/pGDb18kotNuYtCgvLwnvEYoaLH3e2VjZ.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_Relationship_Up_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"あのさ、先生が来てくれて悪くない気分だよ……。ああもう！今の私何言ってんだ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/h9kur8JayUaFJiXFqlGCpph90jSdOEvj.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_Relationship_Up_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"何でだろう……先生に会うと、変な気分になるんだよな……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/qey8ttuAc91kSrTTg6R0xwLnGfaB21ug.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_Relationship_Up_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"ありがとな、先生。先生がいてくれて、良かった！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/oaczTpzTjDrkwCseXuhYng4BqcVW9p7o.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_Season_Birthday.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"はは、先生！今日が何の日か分かるか？別に知らなかった、でもいいけど、 あたしはプレゼントをもらうからな。ほら、い・ま・す・ぐ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/7oH7f6brwXte3OrkfP0g5a9iVoCJTqri.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_Season_Birthday_Player.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"よお、先生。ハッピーバースデー！あのさ…。偶然…もらったケーキがあるんだけど… …食べるか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/G2ayr1BZchaMxZdM0HccwgGfZ1SxMLkw.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_Season_Halloween.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"よお、先生。トリックオアトリートだよ。 …はぁっ？どんな意味か知らねえのか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/KzUApc4TTNb2CbTpZoje1CJjqTk4shf6.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_Season_NewYear.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"よお、先生。ハッピーニューイヤーだな。今年も…だから…。 あぁもう！よろしくってことだよ！！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/VzFFrv45zpmYGuXlHn0exr5p9BVUxYhE.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_Season_Xmas.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"よお、先生。メリークリスマス…だろ？ …ないのか？プレゼントだよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/PXU7pMIIx17l6BDXxq6Yie0lHpDbfSGK.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_Tactic_Defeat_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"負けた？ちげぇよ、まだ勝ってねぇだけだ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/ZdPDVxVWGkVZDYeJjeH5qNTNqwKYRqqD.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_Tactic_Defeat_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"大丈夫だ、次はぶっ壊してコナゴナにしやっからよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/QJc021yakgr6tit4p1t3wIADElgUsmcl.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_Tactic_In_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"へぇ、ここが今回の戦場か。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/p4FXiQFBpjTKTij5UywplVZvXKicgFUZ.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_Tactic_In_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"逃げねぇのは褒めてやる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/1viaegZfPcqxsFTQ5R4xZKnrZPrefj5n.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_Tactic_Victory_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"こういう戦いはあたしの得意分野だからな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/PnA59JVXhPxfN5is95wTLaOsy2cg0dxd.ogg"},{"description":"Neru_Tactic_Victory_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"はっ、先生。思ったよりやるねぇ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%B0%BC%E7%A6%84/5SoHi1d5wRsQ4XowtTtjUB7QtC9KMfuy.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"neru_battle_buffed_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"都说了不用了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/Wt7d4S97f7FXO8fFBCVkrAUJHJyrYimI.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_buffself_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"越看你越不爽——","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/qCU3FLfA2tuWffNQRczLAIj3vGURQ9ER.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_covered_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"好，冲吧！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/Dc1JvvEU5wC6tcPFkFN6qMIJAIdDRpKQ.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_damage_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"（消音）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/AGOjzHXT7wLqOoUhumovipdX0B43F4g2.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_damage_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"麻烦死了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/lzeJIKqBjeLV2ErMoidLF6KeVYwVfkw3.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_damage_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"嘁...","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/ULnUXHjLwuBvTSC1YzOwcrIfuox9yQX4.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_defense_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"就这点本事？！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/omIeLZGdVHKjr44wFZR6npakJP668mHs.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_in_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"小的们,拆场子去了! ","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/dDNxC5dOLT23Dv6VcQmuPd748nDEwn5G.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_in_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"呼号Double 0,开始清扫! ","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/BaIKck3K6gV2oeMaxheKV26xyz18MPmW.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_move_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"差不多收拾干净了,继续!","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/NCPe0wjSkEkJWqNTnGCtK5EPorD0yEJu.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_move_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"挺过瘾嘛,有点意思！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/P7CA9pA8i8NHWrNn9FyUvmFy1Q0aRNSc.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_recovery_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"吼，你还挺有眼力见儿的嘛。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/tB0oDhIa5OSMT7OVXEoYWPVyphS6NLf4.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_retire.ogg","category":"battle","text":"真是,丢人......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/UxPhCZM6YbGq6Eef32Pp2BUfYyYfmEJy.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_shout_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"嘿！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/Z2t6lfkTyjR8MNSJptlldWvg3bzwGwyf.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_shout_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"喝，要上了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/8eBXgWwfDu9SJ7gVDWF0TwuyYBVSetSF.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_shout_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"我打我打！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/onPHkMwLzwbm5rZ7ZaU56mEdQbAC3zUK.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_tacticalaction_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"哼，在那儿啊？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/dD6d4WiOvqqC7fHNvw87iR0E7XlB9JZ9.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_victory_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"一帮杂碎,你们最大的失误就是挡了我的道。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/BfRucju4HgHPOF6Oncw83Rg98RJJlCVb.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_victory_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"清扫完成了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/uqLKbqfJ7HyLkMw7z1tVBp8cqkcj07UG.ogg"},{"description":"neru_cafe_act_1.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"诶,就是...笨，笨蛋！你这个笨蛋老师！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/Z5qHJUHN8P2PTn2B6Thq9RL1VU4FDpt5.ogg"},{"description":"neru_cafe_act_2.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"呃,有点,不好意思...不,不过谢谢了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/0e9fWRcg4fzqLkSbd7mYcrs1vMYL7jgN.ogg"},{"description":"neru_cafe_act_3.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"那什么,就是那个,一,一起去吧!","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/Ief4bc3mPHtfzgJGaDVZ2du1Xe5goRT1.ogg"},{"description":"neru_cafe_monolog_1.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"诶,这个地方还挺不错嘛~","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/LGZDCfmfTRxeo2GyOr5CPMEneFcV3ya5.ogg"},{"description":"neru_cafe_monolog_2.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"怎么,你这是在鼓励我吗？哼,有点意思。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/G6JuM3X088FNSl7Ac3UtOZz0v7Pn72YP.ogg"},{"description":"neru_cafe_monolog_3.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"最喜欢什么样的感觉?这个嘛,当然是赢的感觉啦!","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/8tV4mczLEGeVA4Z3ZVQU8jLjFCnCHgyk.ogg"},{"description":"neru_commonskill.ogg","category":"battle","text":"哈？活腻了吧你？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/MbwqWz7c5uzaYldhcnkrq2pXBPb4k1UC.ogg"},{"description":"neru_exskill_1_a.ogg","category":"battle","text":"啊?宰了你信不信?","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/OpKP2aeriWTJK2izPnM8EAKffgbK01pV.ogg"},{"description":"neru_exskill_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"跟我逗闷子吗你——","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/UcZUnr1xQj7kr4yG3QmSVNT89gzTpDya.ogg"},{"description":"neru_exskill_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"找K是吧——","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/kVcwB25ojRK7I66Z3fezViNbNpe0LBNV.ogg"},{"description":"neru_exskill_level_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"我打我打我打我打！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/8FDUDB0BlxUAaRKui6bY8cCpf1vrWDol.ogg"},{"description":"neru_exskill_level_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"你挑错对手了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/Dc8DBTg7MGsN3yxxpz6c7LXv6bU4Cv3f.ogg"},{"description":"neru_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"垃圾就要扫干净啊!","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/K0jMlTdr4l8oNklJ6bPm7d27htODfB0W.ogg"},{"description":"neru_exweapon_get.ogg","category":"growup","text":"什么叫如鱼得水如虎添翼啊？那就是给我两挺冲锋枪！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/2NiZw2mjr19sYI0MDYhkJJXQ2FrZukmf.ogg"},{"description":"neru_formation_in_1.ogg","category":"formation","text":"哎,要干了是吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/DR2yTNQGnHvIO5AUW8c2gCgBEemJMmzV.ogg"},{"description":"neru_formation_in_2.ogg","category":"formation","text":"烦死了~唉，行吧。 ","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/voBFUJydXjeDi1HTrDfGRyknSBcnLFML.ogg"},{"description":"neru_formation_select.ogg","category":"formation","text":"啊？烦不烦啊？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/yq6O7oIpu3V3FBYvFvC2Uq3IRj7lgoEu.ogg"},{"description":"neru_gachaget.ogg","category":"growup","text":"啊?唉,啧。还是被逮到了。没辙,那只能搭把手了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/xssttFcTbitPS2uBYw6GYSchFlbgcNdp.ogg"},{"description":"neru_growup_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"哼,老师,挺会选的嘛,你就瞧好吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/RG50UaO2XeKe9CqJwAK4wYHfBFcvBuji.ogg"},{"description":"neru_growup_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"诶,感觉挺像样嘛,我办事你放心。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/2IiY4c32w6gd3zLK15Nc6AbIFRkyA4ML.ogg"},{"description":"neru_growup_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"嘿,有点燥起来了,还不赶紧走,老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/tf0xjRAVV2yGlS4E4GBpXMFwOHoB0L4R.ogg"},{"description":"neru_growup_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"老师,自信点,你身边可有我呢?","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/fMXkFgLav9WPT2GoECjN2Vw56N4WvK8t.ogg"},{"description":"neru_lobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"受不了,居然让我等你,真无语。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/UyFutGWJbTzwgmB0uMpwCF9tcCSdkuz0.ogg"},{"description":"neru_lobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"好嘞,去打扫一下吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/Z5y5xvaQGA5LKBIUql7W2QL8UaWqrIwk.ogg"},{"description":"neru_lobby_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"现在知道跟扛把子搭档是什么感觉了吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/tRpxvcM4LrVOcRtaluWtTio6sLrXM9do.ogg"},{"description":"neru_lobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"活儿要踏踏实实地干！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/I5WUmoqVG9SLoJskF6S0KBrcBepVmSoe.ogg"},{"description":"neru_lobby_5.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"需要帮忙就别客气,直接说,什么事都能给你摆平。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/KjQlA3y89Rc7qGNXnt4G4ZL0wrfAped2.ogg"},{"description":"neru_login_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"嘿,老师,你来得也太晚了吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/Yf0bUNZBRrxIHiD5cB05LuRWRZMvfSPe.ogg"},{"description":"neru_login_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"好了,老师,今天也痛痛快快上路吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/S6c9jX8faPTEY5HVmCsJGHR07g1JKwXo.ogg"},{"description":"neru_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"你来啦,老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/4rk680ddMNg9A00lG2og6NnJu742QUJM.ogg"},{"description":"neru_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"这可是我专属的特等席。欢迎你啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/gEDkZg8RdVMDeSVztQ6mTg2pzhHsAjUz.ogg"},{"description":"neru_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"我很喜欢这个地方。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/AQMp7aNWsydeytCx3JKnc8Z2pwzMNJeA.ogg"},{"description":"neru_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"也很喜欢,现在这个瞬间。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/B2zTb6UYQL02oM5yFRgvbbJRkO2zztWk.ogg"},{"description":"neru_memoriallobby_3_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"你问我怕不怕?不怕啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/LFdJnTZceyEkDJaQFZaBTlZXgJL3ABB7.ogg"},{"description":"neru_memoriallobby_3_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"就是,心跳的有点快。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/dBr4QDasXZi1sepBB78zdVno157BtWPz.ogg"},{"description":"neru_memoriallobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"那啥,偶尔像这样偷个懒也不错嘛，哈哈哈哈！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/8Y0MEmgXa3AoPnFkfG3ajtCUZLPlR6U6.ogg"},{"description":"neru_relationship_up_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"就这么近,宰了你啊,真的宰了你。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/vxsRO8n6bRf1VlYXveNsx8mFJ0bWk0us.ogg"},{"description":"neru_relationship_up_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"那什么,老师能来,我心情还不错。哎,我到底在说什么东西啊?","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/Xqzso0qymv5PQ19mhEIZkHcQADgNUiVi.ogg"},{"description":"neru_relationship_up_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"怎么搞的,一见到老师,就觉得怪怪的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/Sf9ZBQO4naHtg5UDsPhMr2X1q9lVhxjM.ogg"},{"description":"neru_relationship_up_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"老师,谢谢了,有老师在,真好。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/QJlsi2aMAazKwl5djiJS08icGm1D2phL.ogg"},{"description":"neru_season_birthday.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"老师,你知道今天是什么日子吗?  不知道也没事,但礼物我必须得收。 快点,一...二...三...","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/HQp0vbH5yHmhg3bsGjh9fxW0jO7pqnuk.ogg"},{"description":"neru_season_birthday_player.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"嘿,老师,生日快乐,那什么,碰巧有人送我一个蛋糕,吃吗?","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/l6hIoZ31wfIvp163N4RZDzKBq4kSXTjU.ogg"},{"description":"neru_season_halloween.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"嘿,老师,不给糖就捣蛋喽。啊?你不懂什么意思?","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/u4M6MrDykfJvPyYLkQtBVRxOBots4jiJ.ogg"},{"description":"neru_season_newyear.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"嘿,老师,新年快乐哦,今年,呃,烦死了,总之,多关照。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/9NiLqlgOLiWygbGNlHMRRZr5EPjLbNLS.ogg"},{"description":"neru_season_xmas.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"哎,老师,怎么说来着,圣诞快乐,没,没准备礼物吗?","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/0pCPujFpTdo6Y80I6s6IX5Tatx5xfHuY.ogg"},{"description":"neru_tactic_defeat_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"输了?才怪,只是还没赢罢了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/7IaDzMvn5yiw2IMzBmGXbe1edPkK4uak.ogg"},{"description":"neru_tactic_defeat_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"没事,下回给他轰成渣!","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/ZCWNlep5dmlcaSPsxhpUhlMfXenTcPyU.ogg"},{"description":"neru_tactic_in_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"啊?这儿就是这次的战场啊?","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/saAG5K2QYGsvjphBnD66FV5jJfVPYe08.ogg"},{"description":"neru_tactic_in_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"没跑嘛？那表扬你一下！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/W6Un7skoIZn6bCtgC20N4jTBPN9mzCcN.ogg"},{"description":"neru_tactic_victory_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"这么打,我可擅长啊! ","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/yjCUO15sn2vrp0YLJpdW6wR1iY9nBTqx.ogg"},{"description":"neru_tactic_victory_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"老师，你比我想的能干多了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/kQWNK0wc3HTKUmsHSnO6YvhVaXGMJEyM.ogg"},{"description":"neru_title.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Archive.","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/vK65fqgif2qYVXieOfQWZMYpdIlRifeU.ogg"},{"description":"neru_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"说了多少次了，我们C&C一般不帮人扫地！新春大扫除不要找—原来是老师啊...那,那也——","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/EZBwl9UvoP31nKGqtbOVSUxFDYMakXyh.ogg"},{"description":"neru_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"哟,老师！就是,呃，就是那个,中秋快乐！嗯？要给我月饼？要是太多了老师吃不了,那我就拿一个！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E9%9C%B2/RctRlOnlbSAefj3tPZZYuePsuXQPQmkv.ogg"}],"voice_kr":[{"description":"Neru_Title","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/original/Neru_Title.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_buffed_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/original/neru_battle_buffed_1.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_buffself_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/original/neru_battle_buffself_1.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_covered_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/original/neru_battle_covered_1.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_damage_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/original/neru_battle_damage_1.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_damage_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/original/neru_battle_damage_2.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_damage_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/original/neru_battle_damage_3.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_defense_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/original/neru_battle_defense_1.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle_in_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%BE%8E%E7%94%98%20%E5%A6%AE%E7%A6%84/original/neru_battle_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"neru_battle